# Migrations only (compose profile "migrate", run by deploy.sh). Copy to /opt/lavieco/env/migrate.env
# (chmod 600). Loaded AFTER the service's own env file, so it overrides MONGODB_URI for the
# one-off migrate containers only; the running services never see it (docs/03 §10.3).
#
# Connection string of the `migrator` account: may create/modify indexes and collections on
# lavieco_identity, lavieco_content and lavieco_program. MONGODB_DB still comes from the
# service file, so one URI serves the three migrations.
MONGODB_URI=
